n't end it and in 1988 the Gold &amp;  Silver Pawn Shop opened its doors with  an initial investment of just ten  thousand dollars big Hoss warned Rick on  April 27th 1983 when Rick was just 18  Cory's childhood took place almost  entirely inside the Gold &amp; Silver Pawn  Shop he started working at the shop at  the age of nine eventually turning that  entry-level position at the store  polishing jewelry into a managerial  position with a 5% cut and the promise  of taking over the family business once  Rick and the old man retire in 2011 the  big Hoss got a lot smaller shedding  close to 200 pounds thanks to a gastric  lap band surgery and dietary changes  designed to help stave off the  possibility of diabetes  good job big Hoss Chumlee the goofy  honorary member of the family who always  seems a step away from getting fired  Austin Chumlee Russell was born on  September 8 1982 his nickname of Chumlee  came from the cartoon Tennessee tuxedo  Chumlee being The Walrus sidekick of the  titular penguin Lee now Chumlee would  you please toss up the sports section  I'll bring it myself  a childhood friend of Cory's Chumlee  joined the staff the  and silver when he was 21 and has been a  constant presence at the shop ever since  including at the Harrisons Christmas  dinner the Harrisons loved to make light  of their friend and his semi frequent  lapses in judgment they just make Cuban  cigars in America chum is probably one  the dumbest thing sheriff said despite  that or perhaps because of it he's  widely considered the most popular  member of the group with the shops own  profile page claiming grills get nervous  around him like perhaps one direction of  the Biebs has just walked into the room  take that with a grain of salt of course  but there's no denying that chump is an  aid to the Harrisons especially with his  knowledge of games pinball machines and  sneakers my god that man loves his  sneakers so this is a lot of my  collection but it's not really it this  isn't everything thanks for watching  click the looper icon to subscribe to  our youtube channel plus check out all  this other cool stuff we know you love  to  [Music]
 

